{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A MAGICAL ADVENTURE THROUGH REALMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hexrite is an action-adventure game set in a stylized fantasy world where you take on the role of a sorcerer embarking on a quest to complete an ancient ritual, in your journey you'll face dangerous foes, meet peculiar beings and transverse fantastical landscapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ARSENAL OF SPELLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have access to a vast arsenal of spells that you can use against enemies and bosses through a classic action-packed combat system, upgrade spells for new uses and uncover forbidden magic to help you defeat your foes! \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/newcombat.gif?t=1746833780\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DOMES OF MAGIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Domes are powerful fields of magic you can cast that change the state of the area surrounding you and your enemies, summon magical mines, conjure up poison clouds or turn the floor into a slippery field! \ud83d\udd2e  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/newdomes.gif?t=1746833780\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FANTASTICAL LANDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Platform throughout floating islands using your various movement abilities, visit haunted cities and adventure inside magical castles! \ud83c\udf0c </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/newtransversal.gif?t=1746833780\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARACTERS GALORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll meet some friendly faces along the way that might need your help, in return for your troubles, you'll be rewarded with items and spells that will aid you on your journey! \ud83e\uddd9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/fixedconversation.gif?t=1746833780\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2621770?t=1746833780","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2621770?t=1746833780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/60ea6fcb344ea8889673c3391ca77eca8fbc8f45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746833780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/60ea6fcb344ea8889673c3391ca77eca8fbc8f45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746833780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3673480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A MAGICAL ADVENTURE THROUGH REALMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hexrite is an action-adventure game set in a stylized fantasy world where you take on the role of a sorcerer embarking on a quest to complete an ancient ritual, in your journey you'll face dangerous foes, meet peculiar beings and transverse fantastical landscapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ARSENAL OF SPELLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have access to a vast arsenal of spells that you can use against enemies and bosses through a classic action-packed combat system, upgrade spells for new uses and uncover forbidden magic to help you defeat your foes! \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragr